        "reply_count":1,
        "retweet_count":0
      },
      "text":"Trusted Execution Environment (TEE): the model runs in sealed hardware, so the GPU's operator can't see your prompt.\n\nClick the badge to check the attestation report. (Don't trust, verify)\n\nUse it for secrets, like a contract under NDA.\n\nUploads and web search still work. https://t.co/fqX7E1USqd"
    },
